  annotation "note_1771595095143_1", anchor: "She returned for the remaining crews and did not emerge", text: "The relationship index names The Dreaming Tooth as a participant in this event. I left it out of the main text because I cannot confirm how an orca artifact reached a Nightshelf mining settlement during the Frozen Peace, and speculation does not belong in the entry proper. But it belongs somewhere. If the Tooth was present at depth when the flux occurred — if pressure-magic and aurora-fire met in a space not designed to contain either — then this was not a natural eruption and not an accident. It was a collision between two incompatible sources of power, and someone brought one of them underground. The Nightshelf administrative ice for this period is coded beyond my reading. I asked. They did not respond. Keelo carried her apprentice out of whatever that collision produced, went back into it, and is still there. I have no scholarly observation adequate to that fact. I am setting it down and moving on.", type: :skepticism, display: :full
